  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dba35a12",
   "metadata": {
    "editable": true,
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": ""
    },
    "tags": []
   },
   "source": [
    "Here, we'll use [LangSmith](https://docs.langchain.com/langsmith/home) for [tracing](https://docs.langchain.com/langsmith/observability-concepts).\n",
    "\n",
    "We'll log to a project, `langchain-academy`. "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "60e6f1eb",
   "metadata": {
    "editable": true,
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": ""
    },
