  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fbd1dab8-0af8-4621-8264-ce65065f76ec",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We can run our chat model in a simple graph with `MessagesState`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "bbd8c39c-633b-4176-9cc6-8318e42bb5dd",
