   "source": [
    "## Sub graphs\n",
    "\n",
    "Here is the failure analysis sub-graph, which uses `FailureAnalysisState`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "f32986a9-6d11-4646-b2c0-fbae4f524579",
   "metadata": {},
