    "## Remote Graph\n",
    "\n",
    "If you are working in the LangGraph library, [Remote Graph](https://docs.langchain.com/langsmith/use-remote-graph) is also a useful way to connect directly to the graph."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "metadata": {
    "editable": true,
